        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "Then earn the hand it needs. No standard of the City moves without spears around it, and no knight commands spears he has not mustered himself. Three of my gate-watch, ser — name the banner-detail to them plain, and when three stand to your word, come back to me."
          }
        }
      },
